# Authentication State
# This directory contains browser authentication state for E2E tests

# SECURITY WARNING:
# Do NOT commit actual session tokens to version control!
# The user.json file is gitignored by default.

# To set up authenticated tests:
# 1. Run: yarn e2e:auth-setup (interactive browser login)
# 2. Or set TEST_SESSION_TOKEN environment variable

# For CI/CD:
# Add TEST_SESSION_TOKEN as a GitHub secret
*.json
